%I A399361 #21 Sep 03 2026 22:49:18
%S A399361 1,1,1,4,12,45,222,1219,7485,49149,337849
%N A399361 The number of 3-connected cubic planar graphs on 2n-4 vertices that can be strongly embedded on the projective plane.
%C A399361 By a theorem of Weiß and Niemeyer, such an embedding exists if and only if the dual graph of the given graph contains a subgraph isomorphic to K_4. The numbers were computed using GAP.
%H A399361 Meike Weiß, <a href="https://github.com/gap-packages/SimplicialSurfaces">GAP Code</a>.
%H A399361 Meike Weiß and Alice C. Niemeyer, <a href="https://dmtcs.episciences.org/19018">Strong Embeddings of 3-Connected Cubic Planar Graphs on Surfaces of non-negative Euler Characteristic</a>, Discrete Mathematics & Theoretical Computer Science, 2026.
%Y A399361 Cf. A399362 (on the torus), A399363 (on the Klein bottle).
%K A399361 nonn,more,new
%O A399361 4,4
%A A399361 _Meike Weiß_, Aug 27 2026
